# No API key required — transcription runs locally and for free via
# faster-whisper (Whisper). Model weights download once and are cached.
#
# Optional overrides:
# WHISPER_MODEL=small          # tiny/base/small/medium/large-v3
#
# Optional free speaker diarization (pyannote.audio). Needs a free
# Hugging Face account: accept the terms at
# https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1 once, then create
# a free read token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens.
# HF_TOKEN=
